# GraphDiff

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphDiff } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphDiff
  title="example"
/>
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `rows` | `DiffRow[]` | `—` | — |
| `footer?` | `DiffRow` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `DiffSign`
- `DiffRow`
- `GraphDiffProps`
